199
00:16:18,345 --> 00:16:20,124
E aapada vachhina nenu ventaaadataanu.

200
00:16:20,580 --> 00:16:22,157
Rakshana kavachamlaa untaanamma.

201
00:16:22,599 --> 00:16:23,660
Sarenaa?

202
00:16:25,675 --> 00:16:28,529
[వేద] Aa mantrikudi nunchi,
vashikarana nunchi

203
00:16:29,410 --> 00:16:31,884
naa biddaki gandam undi maavayya.

204
00:16:33,230 --> 00:16:35,170
Ee kshanamlo em jarugutundonani,

205
00:16:35,260 --> 00:16:36,807
naaku chaalaa bhayamgaa undi.

206
00:16:38,358 --> 00:16:41,554
[అక్షయ] Akshyagaa nenu undadam
valane neeku ee kashtaalamma.

207
00:16:42,873 --> 00:16:46,577
Anduke, nenu malli archanagaa
maaripothe baaguntundi.

208
00:16:49,398 --> 00:16:52,646
Archanagaa unna nannu
akshayagaa maarchoddani,

209
00:16:52,926 --> 00:16:57,000
aa roju nenenthalaa brathimlaadinaa,
nuvvu naa maata vinaledu.

210
00:16:58,267 --> 00:17:02,429
Archanagaa undi unte,
neekinni baadhalu undevi kaadamma.

211
00:17:03,042 --> 00:17:04,833
[వేద] Nenu janmanichhina roopaanni

212
00:17:05,245 --> 00:17:07,084
nenu korukovadamlo thappemundamma?

213
00:17:08,923 --> 00:17:10,632
Thommidi nelalu mosina bidda

214
00:17:10,788 --> 00:17:13,057
e roopamlo ayithe ee lokamloki vastundo,

215
00:17:13,468 --> 00:17:17,000
aa roopame undaali ani
prati thalli korukuntundi.

216
00:17:18,245 --> 00:17:20,251
Ammavaaru neeku e roopamichhinaa,

217
00:17:20,341 --> 00:17:22,064
e roopamichhinaa sare,

218
00:17:22,464 --> 00:17:25,697
aa roopam venaka kachhithamgaa
balamaina kaaranam untundi.

219
00:17:26,942 --> 00:17:28,912
[వేద తండ్రి] Nuvvu akshayagaa
undadam valane kadamma,

220
00:17:29,173 --> 00:17:30,896
nee thandri praanaalu kaapaadukogaligaavu.

221
00:17:33,619 --> 00:17:35,995
Avani cheppinattuga aa ammavaaru

222
00:17:36,085 --> 00:17:37,777
neeku e roopam prasaadinchinaa kooda

223
00:17:37,867 --> 00:17:40,472
aa roopam venakaala kutumba kshemam,

224
00:17:40,703 --> 00:17:42,078
loka kalyaanam untaayamma.

225
00:17:43,356 --> 00:17:45,244
Oka bhaaryagaa, oka biddagaa

226
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:48,126
mee iddaru Sreekar praanaalu nilabettaaru.

227
00:17:50,103 --> 00:17:51,422
Vaadu kachhitamgaa

228
00:17:51,512 --> 00:17:54,041
mee gurinchi aalochanalo
padi untaadani naaku anipistundi.

229
00:17:55,977 --> 00:17:57,749
Thondaralo vaadi manasu maarithe

230
00:17:58,010 --> 00:17:59,509
meeku manchi rojulu vastaayi thalli.

231
00:18:00,716 --> 00:18:02,962
Amma Avani, inka nuvvu emee aalochinchakunda

232
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:04,472
prashaanthamgaa padukondi.

233
00:18:05,250 --> 00:18:08,019
Idigo, ee peedakalala
gurinchi assalu aalochinchoddu.

234
00:18:08,258 --> 00:18:10,169
Kaavaalante nenu bayata untaanuraa thalli.

235
00:18:10,536 --> 00:18:11,926
Meeru prashaanthamgaa padukondi.

236
00:18:12,176 --> 00:18:13,554
Akshaya, paduko thalli.

237
00:18:14,923 --> 00:18:16,026
[అక్షయ] Paduko amma.

238
00:18:39,653 --> 00:18:44,139
SDH [BACKGROUND MUSIC]

239
00:18:58,381 --> 00:19:00,004
[అక్షయ (స్వప్నం)] Meekem kaakoodadani,

240
00:19:00,299 --> 00:19:04,191
amma gudilo nippula gundam
meeda porla dandalu pettindi.

241
00:19:11,159 --> 00:19:12,666
[వేద తండ్రి (స్వప్నం)] Nuvvu brathakaalani,

242
00:19:12,884 --> 00:19:16,489
108 saarlu nee chevilo
mruthyunjaya mantram cheppaalani

243
00:19:16,869 --> 00:19:18,609
mana swamyji gaaru cheppaarra.

244
00:19:19,124 --> 00:19:21,457
Kevalam akshaya cheppaalani cheppaarra.

245
00:19:23,057 --> 00:19:26,645
